      "location": "Facts & Assumptions [F2]",
      "defect": "citation-inaccurate",
      "evidence": "[F2] cites def-germ-of-section for \"(\\varphi_U(s))_x=\\varphi_x(s_x)\". That dependency defines only germs and the canonical map \\(\\mathcal F(U)\\to\\mathcal F_x\\), and says \"If \\(V\\subseteq U\\) also contains \\(x\\), then \\((s|_V)_x=s_x\\)\"; it never defines the induced map \\(\\varphi_x\\) or proves its compatibility with germs. The cited item therefore does not license [F2].",
